<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Adaptive icon foreground — the computed icosahedron at launcher scale.

    Canvas is 108x108dp; only the centre 72x72dp is guaranteed visible, since
    launchers mask the icon to their own shape. The figure spans x:29-78,
    y:26-82, so a circle mask can cut the corners without touching it.

    The stroke runs cyan into blue across the figure — both values sampled from
    the reference logo — which lifts it off the dark background without any
    glow or bloom effect.
-->
